config AIC8800
	tristate "AICSemi AIC8800 series wireless support"
	depends on CFG80211
	depends on MMC
	select CRC8
	help
	  This is the driver for the AICSemi AIC8800 family of Wi-Fi chipsets.
	  The AIC8800D80 is an 802.11ax (Wi-Fi 6) 1x1 combo device found on
	  several Allwinner and Rockchip single board computers, where it is
	  attached over SDIO.

	  The driver talks to the on-chip full-MAC firmware, which has to be
	  provided by userspace through the firmware loader.

	  Say Y or M here if your board has an AIC8800 series device.
